{"articleNo":"82545","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=82545&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"‘2013 한국섬유개발연구원 청년취업아카데미’ 방학중 현장실습생 모집 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.05.02","hit":"8029","attachments":[{"name":"청년취업 아카데미 참여 신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=82545&attachNo=2904"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">고용노동부와 한국산업인력공단이 지원하고, </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">한국섬유개발연구원이 운영하는</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; COLOR: #972d96; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">‘2013 청년취업아카데미’ </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 15pt\">방학중 현장실습생 모집 안내</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">연수받고, 학점받고, 취업도 한다!</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">한국섬유개발연구원에서는 하계방학을 이용하여 연수를 실시하고, 졸업 후 관련기업으로의 취업을 연계하는 “2013 청년취업아카데미”를 실시합니다. 지난 3년간의 사업 운영 노하우를 살려 여러분들을 준비된 예비인력으로 성장시켜 드리겠습니다. 성공적인 취업의 길 청년취업아카데미에 있습니다!</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">⊙ 연수대상 : </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 4학년 졸업예정자 및 졸업자 (졸업자의 경우 만 29세, 군필자는 만 31세 이하)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"> 전공불문</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 연수 종료 후 6개월 이내 취업 가능한 자</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 타 정부지원사업 참여자 및 실업급여 수급자 제외</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">⊙ 연수과정 : </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"28\" valign=\"center\" width=\"161\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">과 정 명</p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"28\" valign=\"center\" width=\"116\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">해당대학</p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"28\" valign=\"center\" width=\"135\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">연수기간</p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"28\" valign=\"center\" width=\"135\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">교육장소</p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"28\" valign=\"center\" width=\"70\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">모집인원</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"50\" valign=\"center\" width=\"161\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">섬유 기술 및 제품기획 예비전문가 과정</p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"104\" valign=\"center\" rowspan=\"2\" width=\"116\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">경북대학교</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">계명대학교</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">금오공과대학교</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">영남대학교</p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"104\" valign=\"center\" rowspan=\"2\" width=\"135\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">2013. 7. 8 ~ </p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">10. 25</p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"104\" valign=\"center\" rowspan=\"2\" width=\"135\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">한국섬유개발연구원</p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"50\" valign=\"center\" width=\"70\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">40명</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"54\" valign=\"center\" width=\"161\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">섬유소재 기획 및 마케팅 예비전문가 과정</p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"54\" valign=\"center\" width=\"70\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">40명</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">⊙ 연수특전</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;하나. 한국섬유개발연구원과 대학과의 협약 체결을 통한 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">학점인정</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"> </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;둘. 현장 및 기업연수를 통한 섬유/패션 관련 업체로의 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">취업연계</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;셋. 국내외 섬유소재 트렌드 분석 및 마켓 리서치를 위한 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">전시회 참가</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">넷.</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"> </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">본 과정과 관련한 교육비 및 교재비</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"> 전액 지원</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">다섯. 취업동아리 및 기업체 면접 지원을 통한 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">맞춤형 취업지원</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">여섯. 연수생 진로 파악을 통한 관련기업으로의 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">현장실무연수</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">⊙ 연수내용</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.kumoh.ac.kr/upload/f280417d-2d82-4ab3-aad4-177d38fe933e.jpg\"></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">⊙ 취업연계분야</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 섬유소재(Textile) 업체의 제품기획 및 소재분해설계분야, 소재 컨버터업체의 소재분해설계 및 외주관리 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">분야, 섬유패션 무역업체의 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">마케팅 분야, 소재업체의 텍스타일 디자인분야</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 패션의류업계 디자이너/MD/텍스타일 디자이너, 온라인 쇼핑몰 마케팅, VMD 분야</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 의류소재 및 산업용소재 연구개발 분야, 염색가공 연구개발 및 실험분석 분야</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 그 외 섬유패션 관련 연구소와 협회</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">⊙ 선발방법</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 1차 : 서류전형</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 2차 : 면접심사 (그룹심사)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">⊙ 신청방법</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 모집기간 : 2013. 5. 1 ~ 29, 18:00 까지</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 자세한 내용은 홈페이지(</span><a href=\"http://www.textile.or.kr/\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><u><font color=\"#810081\">www.textile.or.kr</font></u></span></a><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">) 참조</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 25pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><!--StartFragment--></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; '<!--StartFragment--></span>&nbsp;첨부된 신청서를 작성하여 우편송부 또는 방문제출</p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 25pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;' 제출서류 : 참여신청서 1부 (첨부파일)</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 25pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;재학증명서 1부 (원본)</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 25pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;성적증명서 1부 (원본)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">※ 증명서는 원본 제출이 원칙</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">※ 현장실습지원센터에서 수합 후 한국섬유개발원으로 발송될 예정이므로 모집기간을 엄수하여 주시기 </span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">바랍니다. <font color=\"#cc3d3d\">(29일 18:00이후 제출 시 신청 불가)</font></span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#cc3d3d\"></font></span></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><font color=\"#ff007f\">※ 참여하는 학생 지원 사항</font></strong></span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><font color=\"#ff007f\">&nbsp;-. 방학중 현장실습 3학점 부여</font></strong></span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><font color=\"#ff007f\">&nbsp;-. 현장실습 지원비 400,000원 지원</font></strong></span></span></span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">⊙ 문의처 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;금오공과대학교 현장실습지원센터 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;T. 054-478-7892 / e-mail. </span><a href=\"mailto:imr122@kumoh.ac.kr\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><u><font color=\"#0000ff\">imr122@kumoh.ac.kr</font></u></span></a></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
